  "semantic_contract": {
    "objects": "Actual finite Bool cube, literal normalized count, signed normalized sum and Function.update full flip; distinct external real product law with AE support/permutation/endpoints/shift.",
    "domain_and_quantifiers": "Only signed real f,C2,compact support; allN finite-count domains includingN0, positive successor limit; B,K>=0 internally produced.",
    "assumptions": "No public boundedness, Lipschitz, mass,L1,law or limit certificates; noC3,positivity or normalizedf.",
    "conclusion": "Only full integral-of-sum flip energy ->4 Gaussian derivative-square energy, with genuine finite L1 transport.",
    "definitions_and_normalization": "Flip step=-2sigma/sqrtN; Ndelta²=4. N0 empty-coordinate energy=0 independently of possibly nonzero fprime(0)². Gamma mean0variance1 matches sealed parent36 interface.",
    "constants": "Signed MVT gives |a²-fprime(S)²|<=4BK/sqrtN, full-energy error<=16BK/sqrtN. Authored sufficient background obligations, never supplied outputs.",
    "scope": "Printed FIRST4.6 is GaussianLSI/T2 context only. DirectBool alternative and external SLT real-product route remain distinct OR branches; compiled_edges=[]; no actual37 implementation inspected."
